WEBVTT

00:05:58.622 --> 00:06:01.885
to the networks
of which we all draw our source

00:06:01.909 --> 00:06:03.207
and conclusions from.

00:06:03.231 --> 00:06:04.774
(Laughter)

00:06:04.798 --> 00:06:08.412
So, as I say before the last piece,

00:06:09.872 --> 00:06:13.277
feel not as though
it is a sphere we live on,

00:06:13.301 --> 00:06:17.349
rather an infinite plane
which has the illusion

00:06:17.373 --> 00:06:20.033
of leading yourself
back to the point of origin.

00:06:20.057 --> 00:06:21.390
(Laughter)

00:06:21.414 --> 00:06:23.749
Once we understand
that all the spheres in the sky

00:06:23.773 --> 00:06:25.842
are just large infinite planes,

00:06:25.866 --> 00:06:27.288
it will be plain to see.

00:06:27.312 --> 00:06:28.313
(Laughter)

00:06:28.337 --> 00:06:30.446
(Audience) (Laughter)